ss days, got it. Thank you.":"bef1c28c00f08704.mp3","shimmer|Okay, thank you very much.":"d533ea497838d3d2.mp3","ash|Morning! Are you staying here too?":"0c682fd8893e7b9c.mp3","ash|Good morning! Yes, I checked in yesterday.":"68a0147c3ea5f338.mp3","ash|Hi! Yeah, I'm here for a few days.":"49c11c1ef2d675d0.mp3","ash|Nice. Where are you from?":"91a3021b535e3579.mp3","ash|I'm from Korea. How about you?":"7d758558d9c5f45f.mp3","ash|Seoul, Korea. And you?":"fb179a39c3f8163f.mp3","ash|Vancouver, Canada. First time here?":"760a57b9866b03a8.mp3","ash|Yes, it's my first time. It's beautiful.":"23e79536749cc335.mp3","ash|No, this is my second visit.":"bb0cb13cfaefa554.mp3","ash|You should try the market by the river. Best food in town.":"2c48fed88243b4ad.mp3","ash|Thanks for the tip! I'll check it out.":"2af3cb5351020f65.mp3","ash|That sounds great. Thank you!":"96c84b9f1efc9715.mp3","ash|Anytime. Enjoy your trip!":"d688f7344ce15ad9.mp3","ash|You too. Have a nice day!":"b2154d0462e54f8c.mp3","ash|Thanks, you as well!":"042a4acb74f76d86.mp3","alloy|Excuse me, are you all right? You look a bit lost.":"b19f723d81e08d38.mp3","alloy|Yes, could you help me, please?":"b21b929bf07f6534.mp3","alloy|Actually, I'm a little lost.":"16c94e6eb0764435.mp3","alloy|Of course. What seems to be the problem?":"75ca99c5fd7ca512.mp3","alloy|The ticket machine took my money.":"68bdd7ccd3e0b490.mp3","alloy|I can't figure out how to buy a ticket.":"d51d6f9abab93924.mp3","alloy|Ah, that machine's been acting up all week. Let me get someone.":"5b55ced99cc2ddca.mp3","alloy|Thank you, I'll wait here.":"3b06c7da10ce1507.mp3","alloy|That's very kind of you.":"058893ad90d93590.mp3","alloy|No trouble at all. While we wait — where are you headed?":"fc227a6304db7fbd.mp3","alloy|Central Station. Which line should I take?":"f418a975c5c9d375.mp3","alloy|I'm going to the airport. Is this the right platform?":"61c023b3b6278ffc.mp3","alloy|Line 3, platform two. And my colleague will sort out your refund.":"b999f566e