ht now.":"bd8838e55235adeb.mp3","coral|That's great. Thank you so much.":"994a34e5ef7a7222.mp3","coral|Perfect, thanks for your help.":"9ddbce3841e45edb.mp3","coral|I'm sorry, your card was declined. Would you like to try another one?":"1ddba0569c87f8c4.mp3","coral|Could you try it again, please?":"70fbb5e17e13e25b.mp3","coral|Let me try a different card.":"7f4fa52c144175b8.mp3","coral|Still declined, I'm afraid. Do you have another way to pay?":"d5eaae20590bc9ab.mp3","coral|I'll pay in cash instead.":"faa1da6b7d821346.mp3","coral|Can you try this one?":"cfad38da0741b87f.mp3","coral|That went through. Would you like a receipt?":"2524cae49e2fcfc5.mp3","coral|Yes, please.":"1d36ac60b70315f3.mp3","coral|Could I have a receipt, please?":"86c634fccd2ff871.mp3","coral|Here you go. Just so you know, we charged it in local currency.":"cf0a55be61748a6e.mp3","coral|Local currency is fine, thank you.":"4a4da4b7d9729711.mp3","coral|Good, I prefer local currency.":"41b6ad3632a8cb11.mp3","coral|Great. Sorry about the trouble!":"51a6f3ca3d1f1dea.mp3","coral|No worries. Thanks for your help.":"794c3ccda6c90c54.mp3","coral|That's all right. Have a good day!":"977ed17677be03c2.mp3","onyx|Hi there. How can I help you today?":"46831f5da180412e.mp3","onyx|The ATM didn't give me my cash.":"dff7a4d9fe33bf46.mp3","onyx|I tried to withdraw money, but it failed.":"582cd0029cdceee2.mp3","onyx|I'm sorry about that. Was your account charged?":"5ba146d2fa237a2b.mp3","onyx|Yes, I got a text saying it was withdrawn.":"cda6783fa216dffd.mp3","onyx|I'm not sure. Could you check for me?":"6cb703a1181dc8f9.mp3","onyx|Let me look into it. Could I see your card and passport?":"a3dcf9dfe687500a.mp3","onyx|Sure, here you go.":"4a4d0de11b54dee8.mp3","onyx|Of course. Here's my card and passport.":"729bcfcec0366bf2.mp3","onyx|This is a foreign card, so the refund may take a few days.":"482c05dcd710df5d.mp3","onyx|How many days will it take?":"69ff1b5eb6d0d2f8.mp3","onyx|Is there anything else I should do?":"1